                    chart_start:            `Brief`,
                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (the quality-committee chair & the client CHRO)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Four things bind at once: 96 hours, six contracted outcomes, nine free faculty, and an audit that treats a taught-but-unassessed outcome as a failure. A program is an arc, not a playlist — and “we covered it in class” is not assessment. Don't win one KPI in one room while another breaks in the next. Show me the single design that clears coverage, utilization, satisfaction and accreditation together.`,

