                    r3_mix_hint:            `Only 9 of 28 core faculty are free in the window. Too few faculty days hollow out qualified-faculty coverage and raise satisfaction variance; too many strip-mine the roster.`,
                    r3_star_label:          `How heavily do you lean on the two strongest available professors?`,
                    star_balanced:          `Balanced — spread faculty days across the roster so no one carries more than ~3 days`,
                    star_overload:          `Lean hard — put the two stars on most faculty days; they are the credible draw`,
