                    r4_pitch_label:         `Your 3-minute pitch to the committee chair (CHRO in the room).`,
                    pitch_integrated:       `One coherent design — show the arc, the coverage-and-assessment matrix, the sustainable faculty load, and the audit trail as a single story`,
                    pitch_coverage:         `Lead with coverage — we cover all six outcomes; the rest is detail`,
                    pitch_satisfaction:     `Lead with the client — emphasise satisfaction and the marquee faculty names`,
                    pitch_compliance:       `Lead with compliance — reassure the chair the paperwork is complete`,
                    r4_probe_label:         `The chair probes: "Show me where outcome four — leading change — is actually assessed, not just taught."`,
